#: lib/intro-cards.ts
msgid "Welcome to your dashboard"
msgstr "歡迎使用你的控制台"

#: lib/intro-cards.ts
msgid "Everything lives in the navigation on the left (at the bottom on a phone). Here is what each tab is for."
msgstr "所有功能都在左側導覽列中（手機上位於底部）。以下是各個分頁的用途。"

#: lib/intro-cards.ts
msgid "Today's calls, your plan and shortcuts."
msgstr "今日調用、你的計劃和捷徑。"

#: lib/intro-cards.ts
msgid "Keys, connected apps, and the Telegram and WhatsApp bots."
msgstr "金鑰、已連接的應用程式，以及 Telegram 和 WhatsApp 機械人。"

#: lib/intro-cards.ts
msgid "Calls per day, by client and your credit history."
msgstr "每日調用量、按客戶端統計及你的額度記錄。"

#: lib/intro-cards.ts
msgid "Every tool and the data behind it."
msgstr "所有工具及其背後的數據。"

#: lib/intro-cards.ts
msgid "Which DATA.GOV.HK datasets are converted next."
msgstr "接下來要轉換哪些 DATA.GOV.HK 數據集。"

#: lib/intro-cards.ts
msgid "Ask about live data, or ask it to do things in the dashboard for you."
msgstr "查詢即時數據，或讓它在控制台中代你操作。"

#: lib/intro-cards.ts
msgid "Your plan and allowance."
msgstr "你的計劃和配額。"

#: lib/intro-cards.ts
msgid "Connect your chat client"
msgstr "連接你的聊天客戶端"

#: lib/intro-cards.ts
msgid "Add mcprouter to the chat app you already use, such as Claude, ChatGPT, Gemini, Gemini CLI, Codex or Cursor. Pick your client under Connected apps and follow its steps; most sign in with OAuth, so there is no key to copy."
msgstr "將 mcprouter 加入你正在使用的聊天應用程式，例如 Claude、ChatGPT、Gemini、Gemini CLI、Codex 或 Cursor。在「已連接的應用程式」選擇你的客戶端並按步驟操作；大部分客戶端透過 OAuth 登入，無需複製金鑰。"

#: lib/intro-cards.ts
msgid "Set up a client"
msgstr "設定客戶端"

#: lib/intro-cards.ts
msgid "Quick start: ask the agent"
msgstr "快速開始：向 AI 助理發問"

#: lib/intro-cards.ts
msgid "No setup needed: the Agent tab answers with live data, starting with Hong Kong: the weather, the next bus or A&E waiting times. It can also find pages and prepare actions here, such as creating a key."
msgstr "無需設定：「AI 助理」分頁會以即時數據回答你，由香港開始：天氣、下一班巴士或急症室輪候時間。它亦可在這裡尋找頁面並準備操作，例如建立金鑰。"

#: lib/intro-cards.ts
msgid "Try “What's the weather now?”"
msgstr "試試「現在天氣如何？」"

#: lib/intro-cards.ts
msgid "New: chat with ChatGPT, Gemini and Claude"
msgstr "新功能：在 ChatGPT、Gemini 和 Claude 中聊天"

#: lib/intro-cards.ts
msgid "mcprouter now works in ChatGPT, Gemini and Claude. Connect it once and ask about live data, starting with Hong Kong's weather and transport, right in the chat app you already use."
msgstr "mcprouter 現已支援 ChatGPT、Gemini 和 Claude。只需連接一次，即可在你正在使用的聊天應用程式中查詢即時數據，由香港的天氣和交通開始。"

#: lib/intro-cards.ts
msgid "Connect a client"
msgstr "連接客戶端"

#: lib/intro-cards.ts
msgid "New: the agent on Telegram and WhatsApp"
msgstr "新功能：在 Telegram 和 WhatsApp 上使用 AI 助理"

#: lib/intro-cards.ts
msgid "Chat with the mcprouter agent from Telegram or WhatsApp. Link your account once, then send a message like you would to a friend. Calls count towards your plan."
msgstr "在 Telegram 或 WhatsApp 上與 mcprouter AI 助理聊天。連結一次帳戶後，就像給朋友傳訊息一樣發問。調用會計入你的計劃。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Terminal"
msgstr "終端機"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Add mcprouter as a remote HTTP server."
msgstr "將 mcprouter 新增為遠端 HTTP 伺服器。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Start Claude Code, run /mcp, choose mcprouter and pick Authenticate. Sign in and approve access in the browser that opens."
msgstr "啟動 Claude Code，執行 /mcp，選擇 mcprouter 並點選 Authenticate。在開啟的瀏覽器中登入並批准存取。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Add the server with your key in the Authorization header."
msgstr "新增伺服器，並在 Authorization 標頭中填入你的金鑰。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Run /mcp in Claude Code to check that mcprouter is connected."
msgstr "在 Claude Code 中執行 /mcp，確認 mcprouter 已連接。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Add --scope user to use mcprouter in every project, or --scope project to share it through .mcp.json."
msgstr "加上 --scope user 可在所有項目中使用 mcprouter，或使用 --scope project 透過 .mcp.json 共享。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "claude.ai, Desktop and mobile"
msgstr "claude.ai、桌面版及流動版"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "In Claude, open Settings → Connectors and choose Add custom connector."
msgstr "在 Claude 中開啟「Settings → Connectors」，選擇「Add custom connector」。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Name it mcprouter and paste the server URL."
msgstr "將其命名為 mcprouter，並貼上伺服器 URL。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Choose Add, then Connect. Sign in to mcprouter and approve access."
msgstr "選擇「Add」，然後選擇「Connect」。登入 mcprouter 並批准存取。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "In a chat, open the tools menu and turn on mcprouter. Connectors added on the web also appear in Claude Desktop and the mobile apps."
msgstr "在對話中開啟工具選單並啟用 mcprouter。在網頁版新增的連接器亦會出現在 Claude 桌面版及流動應用程式中。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "On Team and Enterprise plans, an owner adds the connector under Admin settings → Connectors first. Each member then connects it themselves."
msgstr "在 Team 及 Enterprise 計劃中，須先由擁有者在「Admin settings → Connectors」中新增連接器，然後每位成員再自行連接。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "In ChatGPT, open Settings → Security and login and turn on Developer mode."
msgstr "在 ChatGPT 中開啟「Settings → Security and login」，啟用「Developer mode」。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "On the Plugins page, choose Add → Create MCP App. Name it mcprouter, keep Server URL selected under Connection and paste the MCP server URL."
msgstr "在 Plugins 頁面選擇「Add → Create MCP App」。將其命名為 mcprouter，在 Connection 下保持選取「Server URL」，並貼上 MCP 伺服器 URL。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Open ChatGPT Plugins"
msgstr "開啟 ChatGPT Plugins"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Leave Authentication on OAuth, tick the acknowledgement, then choose Create. Sign in to mcprouter and approve access."
msgstr "Authentication 保持為 OAuth，剔選確認項目，然後選擇「Create」。登入 mcprouter 並批准存取。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "In a chat, type @ or open the tools menu and pick mcprouter."
msgstr "在對話中輸入 @ 或開啟工具選單，然後選擇 mcprouter。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Developer mode is available on Plus and Pro, and on Business, Enterprise and Edu plans where an admin allows it."
msgstr "Developer mode 適用於 Plus 及 Pro 計劃；Business、Enterprise 及 Edu 計劃須經管理員允許。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "In Gemini on the web, open Settings → Connected Apps. Under Custom apps, choose Add a custom app and paste the MCP server URL."
msgstr "在網頁版 Gemini 中，開啟「Settings → Connected Apps」。在「Custom apps」下選擇「Add a custom app」，然後貼上 MCP 伺服器 URL。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Open Gemini Connected Apps"
msgstr "開啟 Gemini Connected Apps"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Choose Next. Leave Advanced features closed, as mcprouter registers itself. Sign in to mcprouter and approve access."
msgstr "選擇「Next」。「Advanced features」保持收起即可，mcprouter 會自行註冊。登入 mcprouter 並批准存取。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "In a chat, type @ and pick mcprouter. Once added on the web, it also works in the Gemini mobile app."
msgstr "在對話中輸入 @ 並選擇 mcprouter。在網頁版加入後，Gemini 手機應用程式中亦可使用。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Custom apps need a personal Google Account (not work or school), Keep Activity turned on, and are available in English to people 18 or over in the US."
msgstr "Custom apps 需要個人 Google 帳戶（非工作或學校帳戶）並開啟 Keep Activity，目前只向美國 18 歲或以上的用戶提供英文版本。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "CLI and IDE extension"
msgstr "CLI 及 IDE 擴充功能"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Add mcprouter as a streamable HTTP server."
msgstr "將 mcprouter 新增為 Streamable HTTP 伺服器。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Sign in. Codex opens your browser to approve access."
msgstr "登入。Codex 會開啟瀏覽器讓你批准存取。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Run /mcp in Codex to check that mcprouter's tools are listed."
msgstr "在 Codex 中執行 /mcp，確認已列出 mcprouter 的工具。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Export your key. Add it to your shell profile so new terminals have it too."
msgstr "匯出你的金鑰。將其加入 shell 設定檔，讓新開的終端機也能使用。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Add the server to ~/.codex/config.toml. Codex sends the variable as a Bearer token."
msgstr "將伺服器加入 ~/.codex/config.toml。Codex 會將該變數作為 Bearer 權杖發送。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "The CLI and the Codex IDE extension share ~/.codex/config.toml, so one setup covers both."
msgstr "CLI 與 Codex IDE 擴充功能共用 ~/.codex/config.toml，設定一次即可同時適用。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Add mcprouter as an HTTP server."
msgstr "將 mcprouter 新增為 HTTP 伺服器。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Start Gemini CLI and sign in. Your browser opens to approve access."
msgstr "啟動 Gemini CLI 並登入。瀏覽器會開啟以批准存取。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Run /mcp to check that mcprouter's tools are listed."
msgstr "執行 /mcp，確認已列出 mcprouter 的工具。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Or add it to ~/.gemini/settings.json yourself."
msgstr "或自行將其加入 ~/.gemini/settings.json。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Add --scope user to use mcprouter in every folder. Without it the server is saved to the project's .gemini/settings.json."
msgstr "加上 --scope user 可在所有資料夾中使用 mcprouter。否則伺服器會儲存至項目的 .gemini/settings.json。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Editor"
msgstr "編輯器"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Add mcprouter to ~/.cursor/mcp.json."
msgstr "將 mcprouter 加入 ~/.cursor/mcp.json。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Open Cursor Settings → MCP, find mcprouter and choose Connect. Sign in and approve access."
msgstr "開啟「Cursor Settings → MCP」，找到 mcprouter 並選擇「Connect」。登入並批准存取。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Add mcprouter to ~/.cursor/mcp.json with your key."
msgstr "將 mcprouter 連同你的金鑰加入 ~/.cursor/mcp.json。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Other clients"
msgstr "其他客戶端"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Any MCP client"
msgstr "任何 MCP 客戶端"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Point the client at the Streamable HTTP endpoint. Clients that support MCP authorization find sign-in on their own."
msgstr "將客戶端指向 Streamable HTTP 端點。支援 MCP 授權的客戶端會自動找到登入方式。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Send the key as a Bearer token. Clients that only speak stdio can go through mcp-remote."
msgstr "將金鑰作為 Bearer 權杖發送。只支援 stdio 的客戶端可透過 mcp-remote 連接。"

#: lib/regions.ts
msgid "Hong Kong"
msgstr "香港"

#: lib/regions.ts
msgid "Global"
msgstr "全球"

#: lib/service-content.ts
msgid "Hong Kong Bus, Minibus & Tram Arrivals MCP"
msgstr "香港巴士、小巴及電車到站 MCP"

#: lib/service-content.ts
msgid "Find the stops for KMB route 1A, then show arrivals at Star Ferry."
msgstr "尋找九巴 1A 線的車站，並顯示尖沙咀碼頭站的到站時間。"

#: lib/service-content.ts
msgid "Find green minibus routes in Kowloon and show their stops."
msgstr "尋找九龍的專線小巴路線並顯示車站。"

#: lib/service-content.ts
msgid "Choose the operator, direction and stop before requesting arrivals. Predictions depend on the operator's feed and can change."
msgstr "查詢到站時間前，請選擇營辦商、行車方向及車站。預測取決於營辦商的數據，可能隨時改變。"

#: lib/service-content.ts
msgid "Hong Kong Weather & Warnings MCP"
msgstr "香港天氣與警告 MCP"

#: lib/service-content.ts
msgid "What is the Hong Kong Observatory's forecast for today?"
msgstr "香港天文台今天的天氣預報是甚麼？"

#: lib/service-content.ts
msgid "Show the nine-day forecast and any weather warnings currently in force."
msgstr "顯示九天天氣預報及現正生效的天氣警告。"

#: lib/service-content.ts
msgid "Weather products have different publication times. Check the observation or issue time returned by the source; a forecast is not a current observation."
msgstr "天氣產品的發佈時間不同。請查看來源傳回的觀測或發佈時間；預報並非目前實測數據。"

#: lib/service-content.ts
msgid "Hong Kong MTR & Light Rail Next Train MCP"
msgstr "香港港鐵與輕鐵下一班車 MCP"

#: lib/service-content.ts
msgid "Show the next Island Line trains at Admiralty in both directions."
msgstr "顯示金鐘站港島綫兩個方向的下一班列車。"

#: lib/service-content.ts
msgid "Find the next Light Rail trains at a stop, grouped by platform."
msgstr "查詢輕鐵車站的下一班列車，按月台分組。"

#: lib/service-content.ts
msgid "Heavy rail requests need a supported line and station code. MTR Bus arrivals belong to the bus service. Train schedules can change."
msgstr "鐵路查詢需要支援的路綫及車站代碼。港鐵巴士到站查詢屬於巴士服務。列車時間可能改變。"

#: lib/service-content.ts
msgid "Hong Kong Air Quality Health Index MCP"
msgstr "香港空氣質素健康指數 MCP"

#: lib/service-content.ts
msgid "Show the current AQHI and health risk at Hong Kong monitoring stations."
msgstr "顯示香港監測站的目前空氣質素健康指數及健康風險。"

#: lib/service-content.ts
msgid "Compare the past 24 hours of AQHI at Central with the current forecast."
msgstr "比較中環過去 24 小時的空氣質素健康指數與目前預測。"

#: lib/service-content.ts
msgid "AQHI readings are station-specific and published hourly. Use the source's timestamp and health-risk wording when presenting results."
msgstr "空氣質素健康指數按監測站每小時發佈。展示結果時，請保留來源的時間戳及健康風險用語。"

#: lib/service-content.ts
msgid "Hong Kong GDP & Consumption Statistics MCP"
msgstr "香港本地生產總值與消費統計 MCP"

#: lib/service-content.ts
msgid "Show the latest available Hong Kong GDP and per capita GDP figures."
msgstr "顯示最新可用的香港本地生產總值及人均本地生產總值。"

#: lib/service-content.ts
msgid "Compare real GDP growth with the contributions of major expenditure components."
msgstr "比較本地生產總值的實質增長與主要開支組成部分的貢獻。"

#: lib/service-content.ts
msgid "Statistical releases can be revised. Preserve the period, units, price basis and provisional markers; use pagination to retrieve older observations."
msgstr "統計發佈可能修訂。請保留時期、單位、價格基準及臨時數字標記；使用分頁取得歷史數據。"

